{"version":1,"content":"<p>適逢一年一度的感恩節到來，「台灣歌王」王力宏在家中慶祝節日，更邀得「黑人」陳建州和「范范」范瑋琪作客。</p><p>范瑋琪於社交平台上晒出多張聚會合照，分享與親友歡度佳節的溫馨時刻，展現演藝圈的深厚情誼，最令人驚喜是王力宏的父母罕有現身出鏡。</p><p>&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T08:04:00.192262+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T06:46:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T07:57:19.440353+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T07:57:19.440353+00:00","content_hash":"6bd6cfdd64255c70e0058ef0403af38a8efcab844609f0052cb5830399bba2fd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}